<subsection xml:id="withdraw_deadline" label="withdraw_deadline">
  <title>Drop with a <q>W</q> date</title>
  <p>
    The latest date a student may drop a course (or resign their entire schedule) with a <q>W</q> grade for <custom ref="term"/> <custom ref="year"/> is <custom ref="withdraw"/>, <custom ref="year"/>.
  </p>
</subsection>
